<h3><u>Ghar Ghar Maatam</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Ghar ghar matam</u></strong></p>

<p>(Ya hussain)</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>1. (Basti basti farya farya, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>2. Tere matami ay mere maula, Dunya ke kisi kone me gayaa</p>

<p>(Musruf raha matam me tere) x2</p>

<p>deta he sukoon tera matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>3. jab dil ne kaha ayi zehra, mere gar me bahaane ashke azaa</p>

<p>(bas maine bichake farshe azaa) x2</p>

<p>kuch der kiya barpa matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>4. kal haath bandhe the zainab ke, majboor behen thi matam ke</p>

<p>(majlis he teri ghar ghar barpa) x2</p>

<p>ab karti hai sab dunya matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>5. abbas ke shane kat to gaye, Masum tere pyaase hi rahe</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>gazi ke liye bacho ke liye,</p>

<p>(gazi ke liye bacho ke liye) x2</p>

<p>ab karta hai darya matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>6. aashoor ko jab suraj nikla, zehra ke bhare gar ko dekha,</p>

<p>(par chand ne zainab ko dekha) x2</p>

<p>karti hai bhare gar ka matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>7. karbal se safar tha shaam ka jab, lashe pe pukari ye zainab,</p>

<p>(taa hashr teri mazloomi par) x2</p>

<p>karnaa hai mujhe bhaya matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>8. jo karbobala se sham gayi, wo binte zahra binte ali,</p>

<p>(sab maye behne milkar ab) x2</p>

<p>karti hai sadaa uska matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>9. bimar tha aur zanjeere thi, pairo ke tale jalti thi zamin,</p>

<p>(sajad ke gham me roro kar) x2</p>

<p>karta hai har ek rasta matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>

<p>10. (basti basti karya kaya) x2</p>

<p>tera hota rahe maula matam</p>

<p>(Gar gar matam, dar dar matam, tera hota rahe maula matam) x2</p>
</p>
         